text = "In this game, you take on the role of guiding a satellite 
through a hazardous asteroid field, with the goal of reaching 
the distant asteroid Psyche. Along your journey, you must 
collect mission-critical parts scattered throughout the field. 
Each part is vital to your mission’s success, and when you 
collect one, you'll receive a brief explanation on-screen about 
its function and its importance in the real-world Psyche 
mission.

As you navigate through the field, you must avoid asteroids 
while focusing on gathering essential components. Some 
parts are key to making it to the final stage, so be sure to stay 
alert. Collecting all the necessary components will help you 
reach Psyche and complete your mission successfully.

Learn about the satellite and space exploration by collecting 
parts and gaining valuable insights into how each one 
contributes to the mission's success!"

